      <strong>Project summary</strong>
      <p class="lede">This work focused on sequential recommendation rather than static collaborative filtering. The choice of BERT4Rec matters because bidirectional sequence modeling can better represent user interaction context than simpler next-item baselines.</p>
      <p>The public portfolio version keeps the work honest: not every intermediary artifact is preserved, and not every result is rebuilt on the site. Instead, the page points directly to the repo evidence, the kept report, and the curation notes so a reviewer can assess the project without guessing what is missing.</p>
